modelId.description:
The id of the model that the features are associated with.

If not provided, the champion model of the {@link ReliabilityAsset} with {@link #assetId}
will be utilized.

contributionMap.description:
A map of {@link FeatureFetchBase} id to its raw contribution value. This map should contain values
that correspond to a specific timestamp for a specific {@link ReliabilityMlModel} and {@link ReliabilityAsset}
pairing.
